{
 "rc": {
  "i18n": {
   "zh-CN": {
    "title": "本周节奏",
    "sub": "近 7 天 · 每天达标了几件",
    "today": "今天",
    "masked": "已隐藏",
    "addFirst": "添加第一件要坚持的事"
   },
   "en-US": {
    "title": "This week",
    "sub": "Last 7 days · habits met per day",
    "today": "Today",
    "masked": "Hidden",
    "addFirst": "Add the first habit to keep"
   }
  },
  "cells": [
   {
    "id": "bg",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "0pt",
    "y": "0pt",
    "w": "{parent.w}",
    "h": "{parent.h}",
    "bgColor": "linear(#FFFFFF\\,#F9FCFB\\,#EEF7F3)@90|linear(#15171A\\,#161B1D\\,#182221)@90"
   },
   {
    "_note": "源色点(card-design-system §2):5pt 圆点 / 卡名左侧 / 间距 9pt / 每张卡恰好一次。⚠️ 色值恒 #2E9E6B|#45C793,**不跟事项的调色板走** —— 这颗点答的是「这是 checkin 的卡」,不是「这件事是紫色的」;跟着 pal 变会让同一个包在盘上看着像六个源。",
    "id": "dot",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "14pt",
    "y": "{title.y}+({title.h}-5pt)/2",
    "w": "5pt",
    "h": "5pt",
    "bgColor": "#2E9E6B|#45C793",
    "cornerRadius": {
     "leftT": "2.5pt",
     "leftB": "2.5pt",
     "rightT": "2.5pt",
     "rightB": "2.5pt"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "title",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "23pt",
    "y": "12pt",
    "w": "{parent.w}-109pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "${@i18n.title}",
    "fontSize": "13pt",
    "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "typeface": "System-Bold"
   },
   {
    "id": "sub",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "14pt",
    "y": "33pt",
    "w": "{parent.w}-142pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "${@i18n.sub}",
    "fontSize": "11pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "maxLines": "1"
   },
   {
    "_note": "日期锚(标准 §4.4)。轴上那七个标只有**日号**(`dd`),跨月时读不出是哪个月;而桌面小组件的封面缓存 key 不含时间维度,整张卡停在上周也不报错。窗口 = 今天往前 6 天 → 今天。",
    "id": "rng",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "{parent.w}-126pt",
    "y": "34pt",
    "w": "112pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${wStart},--)] – $[findNotEmpty::(${wEnd},--)]",
    "fontSize": "9pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "alignmentH": "2"
   },
   {
    "id": "k0",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "14pt",
    "y": "56pt",
    "w": "({parent.w}-22pt)/7-6pt",
    "h": "{parent.h}-90pt",
    "bgColor": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c0},#EDEEF0|#20232A)]",
    "cornerRadius": {
     "leftT": "7pt",
     "leftB": "7pt",
     "rightT": "7pt",
     "rightB": "7pt"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "t0",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "14pt",
    "y": "{parent.h}-27pt",
    "w": "({parent.w}-22pt)/7-6pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "${d0}",
    "fontSize": "10.5pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "maxLines": "1"
   },
   {
    "id": "k1",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "14pt+({parent.w}-22pt)/7*1",
    "y": "56pt",
    "w": "({parent.w}-22pt)/7-6pt",
    "h": "{parent.h}-90pt",
    "bgColor": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c1},#EDEEF0|#20232A)]",
    "cornerRadius": {
     "leftT": "7pt",
     "leftB": "7pt",
     "rightT": "7pt",
     "rightB": "7pt"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "t1",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "14pt+({parent.w}-22pt)/7*1",
    "y": "{parent.h}-27pt",
    "w": "({parent.w}-22pt)/7-6pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "${d1}",
    "fontSize": "10.5pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "maxLines": "1"
   },
   {
    "id": "k2",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "14pt+({parent.w}-22pt)/7*2",
    "y": "56pt",
    "w": "({parent.w}-22pt)/7-6pt",
    "h": "{parent.h}-90pt",
    "bgColor": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c2},#EDEEF0|#20232A)]",
    "cornerRadius": {
     "leftT": "7pt",
     "leftB": "7pt",
     "rightT": "7pt",
     "rightB": "7pt"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "t2",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "14pt+({parent.w}-22pt)/7*2",
    "y": "{parent.h}-27pt",
    "w": "({parent.w}-22pt)/7-6pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "${d2}",
    "fontSize": "10.5pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "maxLines": "1"
   },
   {
    "id": "k3",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "14pt+({parent.w}-22pt)/7*3",
    "y": "56pt",
    "w": "({parent.w}-22pt)/7-6pt",
    "h": "{parent.h}-90pt",
    "bgColor": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c3},#EDEEF0|#20232A)]",
    "cornerRadius": {
     "leftT": "7pt",
     "leftB": "7pt",
     "rightT": "7pt",
     "rightB": "7pt"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "t3",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "14pt+({parent.w}-22pt)/7*3",
    "y": "{parent.h}-27pt",
    "w": "({parent.w}-22pt)/7-6pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "${d3}",
    "fontSize": "10.5pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "maxLines": "1"
   },
   {
    "id": "k4",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "14pt+({parent.w}-22pt)/7*4",
    "y": "56pt",
    "w": "({parent.w}-22pt)/7-6pt",
    "h": "{parent.h}-90pt",
    "bgColor": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c4},#EDEEF0|#20232A)]",
    "cornerRadius": {
     "leftT": "7pt",
     "leftB": "7pt",
     "rightT": "7pt",
     "rightB": "7pt"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "t4",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "14pt+({parent.w}-22pt)/7*4",
    "y": "{parent.h}-27pt",
    "w": "({parent.w}-22pt)/7-6pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "${d4}",
    "fontSize": "10.5pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "maxLines": "1"
   },
   {
    "id": "k5",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "14pt+({parent.w}-22pt)/7*5",
    "y": "56pt",
    "w": "({parent.w}-22pt)/7-6pt",
    "h": "{parent.h}-90pt",
    "bgColor": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c5},#EDEEF0|#20232A)]",
    "cornerRadius": {
     "leftT": "7pt",
     "leftB": "7pt",
     "rightT": "7pt",
     "rightB": "7pt"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "t5",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "14pt+({parent.w}-22pt)/7*5",
    "y": "{parent.h}-27pt",
    "w": "({parent.w}-22pt)/7-6pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "${d5}",
    "fontSize": "10.5pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "maxLines": "1"
   },
   {
    "id": "k6",
    "type": "layer",
    "x": "14pt+({parent.w}-22pt)/7*6",
    "y": "56pt",
    "w": "({parent.w}-22pt)/7-6pt",
    "h": "{parent.h}-90pt",
    "bgColor": "$[findNotEmpty::(${c6},#EDEEF0|#20232A)]",
    "cornerRadius": {
     "leftT": "7pt",
     "leftB": "7pt",
     "rightT": "7pt",
     "rightB": "7pt"
    }
   },
   {
    "id": "t6",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "14pt+({parent.w}-22pt)/7*6",
    "y": "{parent.h}-27pt",
    "w": "({parent.w}-22pt)/7-6pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "${d6}",
    "fontSize": "10.5pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "maxLines": "1"
   },
   {
    "id": "now",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "{parent.w}-80pt",
    "y": "13pt",
    "w": "66pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "text": "${@i18n.today} $[findNotEmpty::(${doneToday},--)]/$[findNotEmpty::(${total},--)]",
    "fontSize": "11pt",
    "textColor": "#2E9E6B|#45C793",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "typeface": "System-Bold",
    "hide": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),1,0)]",
    "alignmentH": "2"
   },
   {
    "_note": "打码 ≠ 空态:数据在,只是用户自己盖住了。空态的判据是 `--`/「＋ 添加事项」这类事实陈述与空槽,打码态的判据是 `••` 加这一句主动语态的状态。恒落在卡片右侧最靠上的那个次级小格 —— 空着就新增一格,占着就换掉里面那个量(打码后它读不出东西),见 card-design-system §5.2「卡上只放状态陈述,不放操作指南」。",
    "id": "mk",
    "type": "txt",
    "x": "{parent.w}-80pt",
    "y": "15pt",
    "w": "66pt",
    "h": "-1",
    "alignmentH": "2",
    "maxLines": "1",
    "text": "${@i18n.masked}",
    "fontSize": "11pt",
    "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
    "hide": "$[if::(eq::(${mask},1),0,1)]"
   },
   {
    "_note": "新用户空态入口(2026-10-08 评审 checkin-1/8):一件事都没有时,在幽灵格子上写一行素文提示(infosource-standard §4.4a:无底板、不带 ＋;整卡点开就是首页,在那里添加)。",
    "type": "op",
    "action": "if",
    "props": {
     "val": "$[if::(eq::(findNotEmpty::(${total},0),0),1,0)]"
    },
    "react": [
     {
      "id": "addHint",
      "type": "txt",
      "x": "14pt",
      "y": "56pt",
      "w": "{parent.w}-28pt",
      "h": "{parent.h}-90pt",
      "text": "${@i18n.addFirst}",
      "fontSize": "12pt",
      "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
      "alignmentH": "1",
      "alignmentV": "1",
      "maxLines": "1"
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
 "_note": "本周节奏(42):近 7 天跨所有事项的达标浓淡,最后一格恒是今天。\n⚠️ 色块**高度恒定**,强弱只靠颜色分四档(df 算)—— 画变高的柱要按数据算尺寸,\n而 `{}` 布局表达式里混不进 `${}`;同 rhythm.rcn 的既有姿态。\n⚠️ 日期数字左对齐到各自色块的 x:RCN 没有对齐属性,居中会因位数不同而参差。"
}
